    {
      "name": "Selected event row",
      "kind": "button",
      "description": "Synthetic text sample of a selected event; actual timestamps and descriptions come from the analysis.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-event\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><span class=\"ds-time\">0:24–0:28</span><strong>Сигнал для проверки</strong><span class=\"ds-event-badge\">Приоритет не определён</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-event{font-family:'Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:start;gap:9px;width:100%;text-align:left;padding:20px 22px;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#e3e1e4);background:var(--surface,#fff);color:var(--ink,#252529);cursor:pointer;transition:background-color .15s ease}.ds-event:hover{background:#faf7f9}.ds-event[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--tint,#f8eef2);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px #d3a6b9}.ds-event:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#7b143e);outline-offset:4px;}.ds-event strong{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.5}.ds-time{font-size:12px;font-weight:650;color:var(--accent,#7b143e)}.ds-event-badge{font-size:10px;padding:4px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-weight:600;background:#f0edf1;color:#62566a}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-event{transition:none}}",
      "refersTo": "event-selected"
    },
    {
      "name": "Upload drop zone",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Dashed upload boundary and native file chooser; rose marks drag-over.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-drop\"><svg width=\"38\" height=\"38\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21V5m-6 6 6-6 6 6M5 21v6h22v-6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><h2>Перетащите видео сюда</h2><p>или выберите файл на компьютере</p><label class=\"ds-file\">Выбрать видео<input type=\"file\" accept=\".mov,.mp4,video/quicktime,video/mp4\"></label><span class=\"ds-hint\">MOV / MP4 · до 100 МБ · до 3 минут</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-drop{font-family:'Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;min-height:292px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:32px;text-align:center;background:#fcfbfc;border:1px dashed #bfb8bf;border-radius:8px;color:var(--ink,#252529)}.ds-drop>svg{color:var(--accent,#7b143e);margin-bottom:20px}.ds-drop h2{font-size:20px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:650;margin:0 0 4px}.ds-drop p{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted,#65636a);margin:0 0 18px}.ds-drop.ds-dragging{background:var(--tint,#f8eef2);border-color:var(--accent,#7b143e)}.ds-file{font-family:'Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;position:relative;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:9px 21px;border:1px solid #c6bec3;border-radius:6px;background:white;font-weight:600;overflow:hidden;cursor:pointer}.ds-file:focus-within{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#7b143e);outline-offset:4px;}.ds-file input{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;opacity:0;cursor:pointer}.ds-hint{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted,#65636a);margin-top:17px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Evidence timeline",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Synthetic layout sample of sampled coverage, selected interval and a signal marker, with a labeled native seek control.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-timeline-panel\"><div class=\"ds-timeline-top\"><h2>Хронология</h2><span>0:24 / 1:00</span></div><div class=\"ds-track\"><span class=\"ds-interval\"></span><span class=\"ds-playhead\"></span><button class=\"ds-marker\" aria-label=\"Сигнал на 24 секунде\"></button></div><input class=\"ds-seek\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"60\" value=\"24\" aria-label=\"Положение на видео\"><p class=\"ds-timeline-note\">Выборочный анализ · Сигнал для проверки</p><p class=\"ds-timeline-note\">Между выборками и при ограниченной видимости возможны пропуски.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-timeline-panel{font-family:'Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;background:var(--surface,#fff);color:var(--ink,#252529);border:1px solid var(--line,#e3e1e4);border-radius:0 0 10px 10px;padding:19px 24px 17px}.ds-timeline-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:19px}.ds-timeline-top h2{font-size:14px;margin:0}.ds-timeline-top span{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted,#65636a);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-track{height:18px;background:#e9e7eb;position:relative;border-radius:3px;border:1px dashed #beb9c3}.ds-interval{position:absolute;left:38%;width:10%;height:100%;background:#d6acc0;pointer-events:none}.ds-playhead{position:absolute;left:40%;top:-5px;width:2px;height:26px;background:var(--ink,#252529);pointer-events:none}.ds-marker{position:absolute;left:40%;top:-5px;width:10px;height:26px;border:0;border-radius:2px;background:#6f5c68;transform:translateX(-50%);cursor:pointer}.ds-marker:hover{background:var(--accent,#7b143e)}.ds-marker:focus-visible,.ds-seek:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#7b143e);outline-offset:4px;}.ds-seek{display:block;width:100%;margin:13px 0 9px;height:18px;accent-color:var(--accent,#7b143e)}.ds-timeline-note{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted,#65636a);margin:9px 0 0}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Evidence Workbench",
    "overview": "This is a restrained banking work surface: a light neutral ground, white bordered surfaces, graphite text and burgundy actions. The approved Forte-inspired direction supplies palette and material character; it does not imply an official bank identity. The Russian functional title identifies the task without introducing a product brand, logo or slogan.\n\nVideo, source timestamps and original evidence carry the visual weight. The interface supplies clear grouping and quiet controls so reviewers can inspect a signal and record what they observed. Research limitations are product facts, not aesthetic claims: event types, regulatory matches and guaranteed safety must never be suggested by visual polish or reassuring color.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Light neutral canvas and white, thinly bordered panels.",
      "Burgundy reserved for actions, focus and selection.",
      "Compact system typography with moderate corners.",
      "Source media foregrounded; no generated imagery or decorative charts.",
      "Explicit text labels for state, priority and uncertainty."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Evidence Before Color Rule",
        "body": "Color communicates interface state and review priority; it never certifies an event, legal conclusion or safe interval.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Functional Heading Rule",
        "body": "Headings name the current task or evidence; do not add campaign typography, slogans or a marketing hero.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Flat Surface Rule",
        "body": "Use borders and tonal separation for working panels; reserve the existing inset selection stroke and dialog backdrop for state.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do use the extracted system stack, neutral canvas, white bordered panels and burgundy action states.",
      "Do keep the original video and evidence visually prominent and preserve uncropped source media.",
      "Do pair every priority and coverage color with explanatory text, and preserve unspecified states.",
      "Do use visible keyboard focus, native controls and reduced-motion behavior.",
      "Do stack the workspace at the implemented narrow-screen breakpoint while retaining timestamps and evidence access."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't invent a product name, logo, slogan, marketing hero or decorative chart.",
      "Don't generate or alter evidence imagery or add unsupported boxes, trajectories or detections.",
      "Don't use green reassurance, priority badges or polished presentation to imply guaranteed safety or a legal verdict.",
      "Don't display fabricated progress or uncalibrated confidence percentages.",
      "Don't imply confirmed event types, regulatory matches or generalization performance when the product evidence does not establish them."
    ]
  }
}
